    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 378 of the laws of 2014 amending the environmental\nconservation law relating to the taking of sharks, in relation to the\nexpiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9341",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9341-2023",
